# LoomShield Local-First Configuration
# By default, LoomShield runs 100% locally on-device with ZERO API keys required
# using its Dual On-Device Hybrid Engine (Tier-1 Deterministic + Tier-2 Embedded Scikit-Learn ML/NLP).
#
# Optional: Configure a backend-only API key ONLY if you wish to enable Tier-3 Cloud Escalation.
# Never expose API keys in frontend files.
LOOMSHIELD_CLOUD_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
